        "severity": "major",
        "suggested_action": "Clearly delimit analyses that are affected by ROI aggregation.",
        "text": "Each specimen currently supports selection of only one spatial ROI set, and sequencing data are aggregated across those ROIs rather than retaining individual or multiplexed spatial identities."
